${1:$(format-time-string "%e %B %Y")}

${2:Recipient name}
${3:Address}

Re: consultation of ${4:`(if (boundp 'niori-letter-visit-date) niori-letter-visit-date "DATE")`}

Dear ${5:Dr. Name},

$0

Yours sincerely,
${6:`(user-full-name)`}
